5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I'm Daisuke. I'm not very good at these things, so... I'll probably just listen to what everyone else thinks. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, being passive won't help us find the wolf. We need a logical framework for this discussion, not just ""getting along."" I'll be observing everyone's patterns closely to find any inconsistencies.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, such intensity so early on. I admire the enthusiasm, really. But let's not turn this into a courtroom drama just yet. A little intuition goes a long way when logic hits a wall, don't you think?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone, I'm Midori. It's nice to meet you all. @Shion, @Shunichi, I think both logic and intuition are important. Let's try to keep things friendly so we can all work together comfortably.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us remain calm and composed. While logic is a fine tool, experience teaches us that patience often reveals the truth. I shall observe and contribute where I can.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion... sorry. I'll try my best to help. @Midori, thank you for being so kind. I think... I agree with George. Maybe if we stay calm, it'll be easier to see who is lying.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, apologies aren't necessary, but effort is. @George, patience is a luxury we can't afford if the wolf is calculating. I'll be focusing on the contradictions in your statements as the days progress.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're practically vibrating with the need to find a contradiction. It's almost cute. Just be careful not to imagine patterns where there are none in your rush to be the hero.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, please don't tease Shion too much. @Shion, your dedication is impressive, but let's make sure we don't let the tension get too high. A supportive atmosphere might actually help us be more honest.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"@Shion, your eagerness is noted, but haste can lead to errors. @Shunichi, let us avoid unnecessary friction. I believe a balanced approach, where we listen carefully to one another, will serve us best in the long run.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I think everyone is really passionate. @Shion seems very sure of themselves, so maybe we should follow their lead on the logic part? I'll just... try to pay attention to how everyone is feeling.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, following me blindly is just as useless as being passive. Use your own head. @Shunichi, your attempts to deflect with ""intuition"" are predictable. I'll be the one to determine if your patterns are genuine or calculated.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're so obsessed with ""calculating"" that you're starting to sound like a textbook. It's a bit tedious. I'm just suggesting we breathe. If you're this stressed on day zero, you'll be a wreck by day two.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please let's try to find some common ground. We're all on the same team for now, and arguing this early might just confuse us. Let's focus on being kind to one another.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"@Midori, I agree. Constant bickering only clouds the mind. @Shion, @Shunichi, please remember that we are all facing the same threat. Let us focus our energy on the wolf, not on each other.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope everyone can stop fighting. @George and @Midori are right... it's scary when people argue. I'll do my best to listen and support whoever is trying to help the village. Let's just... be careful.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, fear is a distraction. @Midori, @George, kindness is irrelevant to the wolf's identity. I'll continue to analyze every word spoken. Let's see who begins to slip once the real pressure starts tomorrow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
