23,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, still playing the detective, I see. Your commitment to the role is truly impressive. I'll be sure to keep you entertained with plenty of ""patterns"" to analyze. Good luck with your little project.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, @Shion, I hope you both can find a way to get along. Let's all get some rest and start tomorrow with a fresh, positive mindset. I'm looking forward to working with you all.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
