35,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I hope everyone slept okay. I'm still a bit nervous... Does anyone have any information? @Shion, since you're the most confident, do you see anything suspicious already?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, it's too early for definitive conclusions, but I've been reviewing yesterday's dialogue. @Shunichi's constant attempts to belittle my logic as ""cute"" or ""tedious"" feel like a calculated effort to discredit me before I can find him.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're already jumping to conclusions? How predictable. You're so desperate to find a villain that you're casting me in the role just for having a personality. It's almost flattering that you're so obsessed with me.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please let's not start the day with accusations. It's only the first morning. Maybe we should all share our thoughts more calmly before we decide who is suspicious?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,George,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please. This friction is premature. We have no hard evidence yet, only impressions. Let us take a breath and consider if these accusations are helping us or merely creating noise for the wolf to hide in.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, @Shunichi... please don't fight. It makes me really anxious. @George is right, maybe we're just making noise. @Midori, do you think anyone is acting differently today? I... I can't tell who to believe.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi"",""George"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your anxiety is a liability. @George, ""noise"" is exactly what the wolf uses to hide. By dismissing my analysis as premature, you're effectively protecting the wolf. @Shunichi, your deflection is becoming a pattern. Explain your logic, not your personality.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, my ""logic"" is simple: you're so blinded by your own perceived brilliance that you're ignoring the obvious. You're creating a narrative to fit your ego. Tell me, does it bother you that I'm not playing your game?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please, let's stop this. @Daisuke is getting really upset, and it's not helping any of us. Maybe we can move away from personal attacks and talk about what we actually know?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shion, accusing me of protecting the wolf simply for suggesting caution is a leap. @Shunichi, your focus on Shion's ego is a distraction. Let us stop the personal jabs and look at the facts. Does anyone have actual evidence?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, @Midori... thank you for trying to calm things down. @Shion, you seem so sure about @Shunichi, but... is it possible you're just too focused on him? I don't want to guess wrong... it's too scary. What should we do?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George"",""Midori"",""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, focus. Being ""scared"" doesn't save lives. @George, you keep calling for ""facts,"" yet you offer none. This neutrality is a convenient shield. @Shunichi, your refusal to engage logically is the most telling fact we have.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're practically begging for a ""fact"" to cling to. It's adorable. The only ""fact"" here is that you're trying to bully the group into a consensus because you're terrified of being wrong. Who's actually hiding behind a shield here?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please, this is becoming a cycle. @Daisuke is really struggling with the tension. Can we please try to listen to each other without the insults? We'll never find the truth if we're only fighting.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,George,,"@Shion, your insistence on ""facts"" while ignoring the lack of them is contradictory. @Shunichi, your mockery is not a substitute for a defense. We are circling the same point without progress. Let us consider other players' behavior.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I really don't like this. @Shion, please stop being so harsh to everyone. @Shunichi, please stop teasing. I feel like we're just hurting each other... I'll vote for whoever seems most suspicious to you all. I'm sorry I can't help more.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your submission is a waste of a vote. @George, your ""neutrality"" is a mask for inaction. @Shunichi, your refusal to provide a logical defense is your confession. I'm voting for Shunichi. Logic dictates he's the most suspicious.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your ""logic"" is just a fancy word for a grudge. You've decided I'm the villain and now you're forcing the pieces to fit. It's a boring strategy. I'll vote for you for being so delusional.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please don't let this end in a grudge. It's so sad to see you both so divided. I really don't want to vote for anyone, but we have to. Let's all try to be calm.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,George,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, your mutual hostility has blinded you both. While Shion's aggression is off-putting, Shunichi's refusal to engage seriously is indeed concerning. However, we must be careful not to execute a villager out of spite. I shall vote based on my observations.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
